<title>USA: Abraxas Petroleum Q3 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Abraxas Petroleum Q3 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    loss     $0.12	   loss   $0.10</p>
<p> Net    loss     696	     loss   467</p>
<p> Revs		3,814		    3,289</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,805		    4,457</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    loss     $0.09	   loss   $0.21</p>
<p> Net    loss     520	     loss   959</p>
<p> Revs		11,909		   9,929</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,804		    4,456</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Abraxas Petroleum Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: The third quarter 1996 contained a non-cash non-recurring charge of $369,000 relating to early debt retirement and $235,000 for a loss on securities. Hedging losses of about $200,000 were also recorded in the quarter, the company said.</p>
